{"unit_id":"akslcw__dsh-negative-ledger#card-zh","repo":"akslcw/dsh-negative-ledger","commit":"f530823a5f2c7da3c3d2fa756a74563ff67645d0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-negative-ledger 是一款面向 DSH 编程代理的插件：它在工具执行前后接入策略，并把失败结论保存到本地账本。插件会记录失败命令和缺失文件，依据命令指纹、工作目录及文件观察识别重复尝试；证据未变化时可提醒或阻止调用，文件状态变化后撤销旧结论，成功重试后标记已解决。它还提供 SQLite 与 JSONL 存储、命令依赖证据和账本统计。适合希望减少重复失败尝试、管理重试条件的 DSH 用户。默认使用 SQLite，并在工作目录的 .ledger 中保存数据，不需要 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:900-918","src/plugin.ts:1032-1055","src/plugin.ts:1113-1163","src/store-sqlite.ts:173-186","src/engine.ts:69-80"]}
{"unit_id":"akslcw__dsh-negative-ledger#card-en","repo":"akslcw/dsh-negative-ledger","commit":"f530823a5f2c7da3c3d2fa756a74563ff67645d0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-negative-ledger records failed commands and missing files in a local DSH ledger. It warns or blocks repeats while evidence is unchanged, permits retries when observed files change, and resolves successful retries. It supports SQLite and JSONL storage; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:900-918","src/plugin.ts:1032-1055","src/plugin.ts:1113-1163","src/store-sqlite.ts:173-186","src/engine.ts:69-80"]}
